          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_73",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Gweddry, you saw how Dacyn struggled to channel his Light. What do you think of this?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dolburras",
            text: _("Aye, and have ye noticed the man’s cough? He be trying to hide it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("... it is a bad sign, to be sure. But Dacyn is determined to protect Wesnoth and destroy Mal-Ravanal, and I believe he is our only chance at doing so."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grug",
            text: _("Magic man kind! Be good magic man be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("I agree his intentions are good, but with each passing hour, that foul amulet’s darkness festers within him. What influence may it have?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Terraent",
            text: _("I choose to place my faith in the holy Light, not the darkness! We will overcome Mal-Ravanal’s evil, and this dark amulet’s as well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hahid al-Ali",
            text: _("Bah, magic! There’s a reason the civilized people of my world eschew magic — we would never have to deal with problems like this back in my homeland."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_74",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
              },
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22have_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Mortic%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("(squinting) I can’t see anything in this searing sunlight. Fall back, wait for dusk!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
